stow
Includes storage and inventory utilities developed in the custom Mouse Wheelie port.
Mouse Wheelie: Copyright 2020–2026 Siphalor and contributors, Apache License 2.0.
Mouse Wheelie's stack combination, chained-permutation client sorting, creative
catalogue lookup and sort modes are retained and adapted for stow's guarded queue.
Storage utilities have been extracted, renamed and modified for this project.
Cloth Config is a separate required dependency, used through its public API.
No third-party configuration library or server networking code is bundled.

Inventory/menu action icons: Material Design Icons, by Pictogrammers and contributors,
Apache License 2.0. https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/
Upstream: https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign-SVG
Commit: 9e04201d4557e729822fb57f62a316c3dea1d4a8
Selected SVG paths are retained unchanged in the source. Runtime modifications:
rasterized to 64px white alpha-mask PNGs for centered 16px Minecraft GUI rendering.
The upstream Pictogrammers Free License is retained with source icons and at
assets/stow/textures/gui/icons/LICENSE; this project's LICENSE includes Apache 2.0.
